# Build output (GitHub Actions builds this itself from the source)
dist/

# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# Original, full-size camera files never go in the repo. Only the web-sized
# copies that tools/media.js writes into media/ are committed.
_originals/
*.mov
*.MOV
*.raf
*.RAF
*.dng
*.DNG

# Notes about where original files live on Ayden's own computer. They contain
# local folder paths, so they stay on this PC and are not published.
tools/media-sources.json
tools/photo-sources.json

# The list of open questions for Ayden. It names unpublished client work and
# files on his drives, so it stays on this PC too.
docs/NEEDS-FROM-AYDEN.md

# The heading font, Gambarino. Its license (ITF Free Font License, Fontshare)
# allows hosting it on Ayden's own website but not passing the file on through
# a public repository, and this repository is public. `node tools/fonts.js`
# downloads it from Fontshare: once on this PC, and again each time the site
# is published (see .github/workflows/deploy.yml).
src/assets/fonts/Gambarino-Regular.woff2

